  data: {
    LLM: "Do not burn all your non-trump high cards (Aces/Kings) early. In Severnyi, those 'junk' cards might become trumps in the final five minutes of the game.\n\nHand Diversification: Unlike standard Durak where you want to empty yourself of non-trump suits, in Severnyi, you should try to keep at least one high card of every suit until the final card is revealed.\n\nCounting the Talon: Track how many cards are left in the stock. If you are the one about to draw the final card, try to ensure you have a hand that benefits from a 'random' suit becoming trumps.",
    Player: "Do not burn all your non-trump high cards (Aces/Kings) early. In Severnyi, those 'junk' cards might become trumps in the final five minutes of the game.\n\nHand Diversification: Unlike standard Durak where you want to empty yourself of non-trump suits, in Severnyi, you should try to keep at least one high card of every suit until the final card is revealed.\n\nCounting the Talon: Track how many cards are left in the stock. If you are the one about to draw the final card, try to ensure you have a hand that benefits from a 'random' suit becoming trumps.",
